                                    <p>The tablet is inscribed on <rs type="texts" key="multiple" n=""/><rs type="sides" key="opisthographic">both sides</rs>. The same side also preserves another inscription (<ref target="i-dodone-online-5a">5A</ref>), inscribed upside down in relation to the present text, as well as traces of earlier inscriptions that remain discernible but are no longer legible. Two further inscriptions (<ref target="i-dodone-online-7b">7B</ref> and <ref target="i-dodone-online-8b">8B</ref>) are preserved on the reverse of the tablet.</p>
